OL,3,GNEWSACharity assists boats along
OL,4,Adrought-affected canal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA waterways charity is helping
OL,7,Ftransport boats after low water levels
OL,8,Fclosed a canal.
OL,10,FThe project by the Canal and River
OL,11,FTrust is to move six boats throughout
OL,12,FOctober along the locks to Tooley's
OL,13,FBoatyard in Banbury, Oxfordshire, with
OL,14,Fan army of volunteers removing the
OL,15,Fchains and opening locks.
OL,17,FThe 248-year-old boatyard has been on
OL,18,Fthe brink of closure, with Matt
OL,19,FArmitage, the boatyard's managing
OL,20,Fdirector, calling the situation
OL,21,F"incredibly challenging".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
